<title>FRANCE: Rouen Jan 1-29 grain exports 457,758 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Jan 1-29 grain exports 457,758 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 457,758 tonnes between January 1 and January 29, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 418,000 tonnes in the whole of January 1996.</p>
<p>The 457,758 tonnes included 321,693 tonnes of wheat and 136,065 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		   42,041</p>
<p>    Algeria			 45,500</p>
<p>    Canary Islands		13,100</p>
<p>    Cuba			    23,141</p>
<p>    Egypt			   37,500</p>
<p>    Britain			 13,525</p>
<p>    Greece			   5,500</p>
<p>    Ireland			  4,535</p>
<p>    Italy			  116,401</p>
<p>    Morocco			 10,500</p>
<p>    Portugal			 2,950</p>
<p>    Turkey			   7,000</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		 106,611</p>
<p>    China			   22,000</p>
<p>    Italy			    7,454</p>
